{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YYPyUkDsRd1Gnc93RKNPvX","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Electric Highway Tasmania fast chargers app pay Chargefox\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/217292\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/243112\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/247644\"},{\"title\":\"Electric Highway Tasmania\",\"url\":\"https://www.aeva.asn.au/files/364/\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/473841\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/202314\"},{\"title\":\"Public fast chargers - payment methods\",\"url\":\"https://teslamotorsclub.com/tmc/threads/public-fast-chargers-payment-methods.196651/\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/475323\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/477293\"},{\"title\":\"Tasmanian Fast / Ultra Fast chargers\",\"url\":\"https://teslamotorsclub.com/tmc/threads/tasmanian-fast-ultra-fast-chargers.98249/page-4\"}]\n\nElectric Highway Tasmania (EHT) chargers are paid for through Chargefox. Some sites also take credit cards directly.\n\n- **How you pay:** PlugShare listings for many EHT sites say Pay with the Chargefox App or Chargefox Card. Some sites also take credit cards, for example a 75/50 kW site where you can pay with the Chargefox app, or an RFID card linked to your Chargefox account, or credit card. A 2021 Tesla forum post says EHT accepts the Chargefox card/app and also direct credit card payment (Paypass/Paywave and presumably anything else using the same tech such as Apple Pay). Several newer sites (24 kW DC and 80 kW) list only the Chargefox app or card, so a credit card reader isn't guaranteed everywhere.\n- **Chargefox's role:** EHT use Chargefox as a billing partner. At one site with poor mobile reception, you can access free wifi to activate session via app.\n- **Ownership:** An older forum post (about 3.7 years old) says the NRMA made a minority investment into Electric Highway Tasmania (EHT), and that it doesn't appear to impact their arrangement with Chargefox for activating/billing. Another snippet says NRMA owns all of the electric highway Tasmania's electric vehicle charging sites and suggests for real-time updates on individual chargers please check the Chargefox app. These two claims don't agree, so who owns the network now isn't clear.\n- **Hardware and pricing (from an early AEVA presentation, likely out of date):** Sites were planned with a 50 kW DC Tritium charger and a 22 kW AC charger. Pricing was 50 kW DC: 25 cents / minute + 25 cents / kWh.\n\nMost of these sources are old forum posts and user-edited PlugShare listings, so current payment options and prices should be checked in the Chargefox app.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b400f4c1-5085-47c3-af7a-8e6a57ec0ba2","uuid":"687cc943-28f1-4adb-9122-01cdfd6cda78","timestamp":"2026-11-19T11:45:31.661Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Electric Highway Tasmania fast chargers app pay Chargefox","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01X6QZo3V83DQYKwky1buQi3","content":[{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/217292"},{"title":"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You","url":"https://www.plugshare.com/location/243112"},{"title":"PlugShar